code-indexer-mcp — MCP server over the code index (stdio transport).

registered tools (7):
  find_callers       Who references this symbol — BFS over the reference tables (fan-in),
  find_references    Find textual references TO a symbol: calls, inherits, includes (all
  find_symbol        Look up a symbol by name in the manifest symbol index (exact AST-first,
  get_code_context   Retrieve ONLY the relevant source lines instead of reading whole
  list_projects      List registered projects with their index summary (path, slug, state,
  overview           Project map for orientation: languages, directories, entry points,
  skeleton           Whole-project or per-subtree structural map from the manifest only:

semantic_search is not registered: the semantic extra is not installed (code-indexer[semantic]).

removed in this release — use the CLI subcommand of the same name:
  add_project, index_status, lookup_project, reindex_project, remove_project, changed_symbols, deps, find_callees, find_definition, find_symbols, outline

install: uvx --from "code-indexer[mcp]" code-indexer-mcp
